{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Magic Dialer Pro 是一款主打極速撥號的電話工具，適合經常致電固定客戶、家人或同事的使用者。它把常用聯絡人化成主畫面小工具，配合智能 T9 搜尋，讓致電步驟大幅減少。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>智能 T9 搜尋輕鬆找出聯絡人</h2>\n<p>Magic Dialer Pro 可將常用聯絡人放在主畫面小工具，點一下即可致電，也能把號碼指派到鍵盤，長按即撥。內置智能 T9 搜尋，輸入名稱或號碼即可找出聯絡人，並優先顯示常用號碼、短名稱與有相片的聯絡人。程式支援繁體及簡體中文、單手操作模式，以及深色與淺色主題與多款配色。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-355-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-356-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-357-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-358-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-359-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-360-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Magic Dialer Pro – T9 Dialer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T12:58:36.239733+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}